Sprite atlas license
====================

This directory contains the "whale-refined" sprite atlas from
@linxin666/dsh-pet v0.4.8 (https://www.npmjs.com/package/@linxin666/dsh-pet).

Provenance
----------
- Source file: assets/whale-refined/spritesheet.webp in that package
- Frame layout and timing: assets/whale-refined/pet.json (also in that package)
- Redistributed here unmodified apart from the container format
  (lossless WebP -> PNG, so the iOS asset pipeline needs no WebP decoder).

License
-------
The upstream asset manifest (assets/whale-refined/pet.json) declares this pet
as MIT. The surrounding package declares Apache-2.0 for its own code; that
applies to the code, not to this art asset.

